Age limit: 18+. You must apply to the entrance rules.

Artists subject to change. 

Karrusel will take place rain or shine.

**IMPORTANT: A ticket is valid for one entry only pr day. Once you leave the Karrusel Festival area, re-entry is not permitted.**

For companion tickets, please contact Tickster customer support. 

Photography/filming will take place at the event. By entering, you consent to the use of your likeness for the festival's future promotional use.

